2026-01-01 open Assets:Bank
2026-01-01 open Expenses:Food

2026-02-01 * "a wide plain number: every aligned line ends at its column"
  Expenses:Food  1,000,000.00 EUR
  Assets:Bank  -1,000,000.00 EUR

2026-03-01 * "one operation in parentheses"
  Expenses:Food  (4 + 2.5) EUR
  Assets:Bank  -6.5 EUR

2026-03-02 * "two operations"
  Expenses:Food  (4 + 2 + 0.5) EUR
  Assets:Bank  -6.5 EUR

2026-03-03 * "no parentheses"
  Expenses:Food  4+2 EUR
  Assets:Bank  -6 EUR

2026-03-04 * "a sign before the parentheses"
  Expenses:Food  -(2) EUR
  Assets:Bank  2 EUR

2026-03-05 * "one number in parentheses"
  Expenses:Food  (5) EUR
  Assets:Bank  -5 EUR

2026-03-06 * "an operation after the parentheses"
  Expenses:Food  (1 + 2) * 3 EUR
  Assets:Bank  -9 EUR

2026-03-07 * "a sign, then a blank, then the number"
  Expenses:Food  - 5 EUR
  Assets:Bank  5 EUR
